Package: limeboard-ha
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Citronics <info@citronics.eu>
Depends: python3, python3-paho-mqtt, python3-psutil, limeboard-io (>= @VERSION@)
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Citronics/limeboard-extras
Description: Limeboard as a Home Assistant device over MQTT
 limeboard-ha publishes the Limeboard (its RGB LED and button) and the
 phone's state and sensors to Home Assistant through MQTT discovery. It
 idles until a broker is set in /etc/limeboard-ha.conf.
